    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have to match tiles in pairs until all of tiles are gone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once two tiles have been matched, they will disappear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you click on a tile - it becomes highlighted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can select a tile, when it has at least one side edge free.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(no other tiles touching it, and cannot have any tiles on top of it).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By purchasing the game, you will get the opportunity to complete 100 levels in this exciting board and logic game Mahjong.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have to match tiles in pairs until all of tiles are gone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once two tiles have been matched, they will disappear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you click on a tile - it becomes highlighted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can select a tile, when it has at least one side edge free.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(no other tiles touching it, and cannot have any tiles on top of it).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By purchasing the game, you will get the opportunity to complete 100 levels in this exciting board and logic game Mahjong.</p>",
    "short_description": "You have to match tiles in pairs until all of tiles are gone. Once two tiles have been matched, they will disappear. When you click on a tile - it becomes highlighted. You can select a tile, when it has at least one side edge free. No other tiles touching it, and cannot have any tiles on top of it.",
